      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Status: Draft Date: 2026-05-13 Branch: main HEAD: e389b446706173ebc5950931994ba4cdb6a7d9f4 Scope: Read-only security audit Owner area: security",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Executive Summary",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This audit identifies sensitive data risks in Rig Relay's evidence storage. The primary risk is the leakage of absolute filesystem paths and environment secrets into project-local evidence files, which could be accidentally committed to version control.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Evidence Privacy Inventory",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Observability JSONL**: Contains full message history (potentially sensitive code/secrets). - **Context Reports**: Contains tool schemas and system prompts. - **Artifacts**: Contains raw tool outputs (e.g., `cat` of a config file). - **Shadow Requests**: Contains the full payload sent to the LLM.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Sensitive Field Map",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-8",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Field",
        "Location",
        "Risk"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`artifact_path`",
          "`observability.jsonl`",
          "Leakage of absolute user home paths."
        ],
        [
          "`content`",
          "`artifacts/*.json`",
          "Leakage of file contents/secrets read by tools."
        ],
        [
          "`api_base`",
          "`config.toml`",
          "Leakage of private proxy/endpoint URLs."
        ],
        [
          "`payload`",
          "`shadow_request_*.json`",
          "Leakage of full conversation state."
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Redaction Gap List",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- No current automatic redaction of `$HOME` in paths. - No current \"Secret Scrubber\" for tool outputs before they hit the filesystem.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Recommended Gitignore/Default Behavior",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Action**: Rig Relay should automatically add `.rig/relay/` to the repo's `.gitignore` if it initializes repo-local evidence. - **Action**: Add a \"Privacy Mode\" that hashes all paths and redacts message content, leaving only usage/token metrics.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Test Recommendations",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `test_no_absolute_paths_in_evidence` - `test_secrets_in_env_not_leaked_to_logs`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Future Implementation Backlog",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- [ ] Implement path normalization (relative to project root). - [ ] Add a `--private` flag to suppress content logging. - [ ] Create a `doctor` check for accidental credential leakage in evidence files.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
